Hello World!

Examples
--------

examples/crawl_site.py crawls a small site with the Firecrawl API and saves each
page's markdown to a file.

    export FIRECRAWL_API_KEY="fc-..."
    pip install -r examples/requirements.txt
    python examples/crawl_site.py https://example.com --limit 5 --out pages

Get an API key and read the docs at https://docs.firecrawl.dev
